# Code owners — review routing for UKBT.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owner automatically when a PR touches
# a matching path. On its own this is advisory; it becomes enforcement
# only when `main`'s branch-protection rule enables "Require review from
# Code Owners" (see docs/11-github-branch-protection.md).
#
# Solo-maintainer project: one owner, with sensitive paths listed
# explicitly so a future second contributor inherits the routing rather
# than needing it reconstructed.

# Default owner for everything not matched more specifically below.
*                           @LabLaunchPad

# Governance substrate — the files that define what "correct" means here.
# A change to these changes the rules the rest of the repo is judged by,
# so they are called out rather than left to the catch-all above.
/CLAUDE.md                  @LabLaunchPad
/AGENTS.md                  @LabLaunchPad
/contracts/                 @LabLaunchPad
/knowledge/                 @LabLaunchPad
/docs/                      @LabLaunchPad
/prompts/                   @LabLaunchPad
/adversarial/               @LabLaunchPad

# Release + deployment surface. A change here can put something live, or
# change what "green" means.
/.github/                   @LabLaunchPad
/wrangler.jsonc             @LabLaunchPad
/scripts/                   @LabLaunchPad
/artifacts/receipts/        @LabLaunchPad

# Truth/provenance enforcement and the real organizational facts it gates.
/packages/truth/            @LabLaunchPad
/apps/web/src/content/      @LabLaunchPad
